<section class="home-what-we-do" id="what-we-do">
	<h1 class="home-what-we-do_title">What we do</h1>
	<div class="home-what-we-do_body">
		<p>
			The Practical Causal Inference (PCI) Lab at UCLA advances and applies
			methodologies that help researchers and practitioners reach safer, more
			defensible causal conclusions in real-world settings. Our focus is on
			leveraging available information, while reducing the danger of
			over-confidence in estimates that may be biased by unrealistic
			assumptions. The lab serves as a multidisciplinary hub, bringing together
			scholars from across campus to learn from one another, fostering training
			and mentorship, and leading collaborative initiatives within UCLA and with
			external partners.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
